<p>Alright, not sentience, but behavior then. What do they say when killed? How fast they regenerate? Can they tend their wounds?</p>
<p>Regarding the tone. here's an example:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>If the damage done would be non-lethal to a human of similar size, then it is repaired at a rapid rate.</p>
