<p>I'd word it something like</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Damage that would be non-lethal to a normal human of similar size is repaired at a rapid rate.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I suppose there is nothing explicitly wrong with you version. It just seems odd to me for some reason.</p>
<p>Also, something I completely forgot to comment on the first time: why are they all so fucking short? I thought that they were anatomically identical to their originals. You should probably add ~0.3 meters to their height.</p>
<p>If the original remains brain-dead, the fact that 1610-C is made from the head researcher is a bit confusing. Seeing as Cs and Ds are both marked, and Ds were made later, the research was still ongoing at the time Cs were created. If so, who lead the research? I'd imagine that when researchers kill themselves or desert, and then the head researcher trows himself in the vat, they'd just stop the whole thing. Did PL send someone else to lead the project?</p>

